{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49655","headline":"定风波 · 欧阳炯","name":"定风波","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖日闲窗映碧纱，小池春水浸晴霞。\n数树海棠红欲尽，争忍，玉闺深掩过年华。\n独凭绣牀方寸乱，肠断，泪珠穿破脸边花。\n邻舍女郎相借问，音信，教人羞道未还家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}